window.Apuntes.registrarPane("pyl/u3/teoria", "<section class=\"pane\" data-view=\"pyl/u3/teoria\" data-tab-owner=\"teoria\">\n  <h1>Unidad 3 &mdash; De expresi\u00f3n regular a AFD m\u00ednimo</h1>\n\n  <p class=\"pane-intro\">\n    El ejercicio 2 del parcial, el que m\u00e1s vale (60 puntos): <em>\"Dada la siguiente ER, pasar a\n    aut\u00f3mata determin\u00edstico m\u00ednimo\"</em>. Son tres algoritmos de la c\u00e1tedra, uno detr\u00e1s del otro:\n    Thompson (ER &rarr; AFN-\u03b5), subconjuntos (AFN-\u03b5 &rarr; AFD) y minimizaci\u00f3n (AFD &rarr; AFD m\u00ednimo).\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"bloque\" data-abierta>\n    <p class=\"kicker\">Antes de leer</p>\n    <h2>C\u00f3mo leer esta unidad</h2>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Secci\u00f3n</th><th>Qu\u00e9 tiene</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">1. Thompson</td><td>Las reglas para armar el AFN-\u03b5 pieza por pieza</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">2. Subconjuntos</td><td>\u03b5-clausura, mueve y la tabla que da el AFD</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">3. Minimizaci\u00f3n</td><td>Partir los estados en grupos hasta que no cambien</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">4. La receta en la hoja</td><td>Los tres pasos juntos, en el orden en que se entregan</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>Las tres primeras secciones usan la misma ER chica (<code>ab*</code>) para que se vea c\u00f3mo encaja cada paso con el siguiente. Despu\u00e9s, la Pr\u00e1ctica tiene siete ER resueltas enteras.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bloque\">\n    <p class=\"kicker\">Paso 1 de 3</p>\n    <h2>1. Thompson: de ER a AFN-\u03b5</h2>\n\n    <h3>Qu\u00e9 es</h3>\n    <p>\n      Una receta que arma el aut\u00f3mata <strong>pieza por pieza</strong>, siguiendo c\u00f3mo se eval\u00faa la ER\n      (primero las <code>*</code>, despu\u00e9s las concatenaciones, al final las <code>|</code>). Cada\n      pieza tiene <strong>un solo inicial y un solo final</strong>, al final no le sale nada y al\n      inicial no le entra nada: por eso se pueden enchufar entre s\u00ed.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3>Las reglas</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Para</th><th>Se construye</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u2205</td><td>Un inicial y un final, sin flecha</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u03b5</td><td>Inicial &mdash;\u03b5&rarr; final</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">un s\u00edmbolo a</td><td>Inicial &mdash;a&rarr; final</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">r | s</td><td>Un inicial nuevo con \u03b5 a las dos piezas; un final nuevo al que llegan las dos con \u03b5</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">r s</td><td>El final de r <strong>es</strong> el inicial de s (se funden en un solo estado)</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">r*</td><td>Inicial y final nuevos, y cuatro \u03b5: entrar a r, salir de r, volver del final al inicial de r (repetir) y del inicial nuevo al final nuevo (cero veces)</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>C\u00f3mo se ven</h3>\n    <p><strong>\u03b5</strong> y <strong>un s\u00edmbolo</strong>:</p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-th-eps\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -31 220 62\" width=\"220\" height=\"62\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Thompson para \u03b5\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L109.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M109.0,0.0 L100.0,4.5 L100.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"64.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">i</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"128.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"128.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"128.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">f</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-th-a\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -31 220 62\" width=\"220\" height=\"62\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Thompson para un s\u00edmbolo\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L109.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M109.0,0.0 L100.0,4.5 L100.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"64.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">i</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"128.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"128.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"128.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">f</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p><strong>Uni\u00f3n</strong>, <code>a|b</code>:</p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-th-union\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -67 332 134\" width=\"332\" height=\"134\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Thompson para a|b\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,-36.0 L141.0,-36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,-36.0 L132.0,-31.5 L132.0,-40.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"-46.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,36.0 L141.0,36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,36.0 L132.0,40.5 L132.0,31.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"26.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,-7.8 L62.7,-28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M62.7,-28.2 L56.3,-20.4 L52.6,-28.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"35.3\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,7.8 L62.7,28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M62.7,28.2 L52.6,28.6 L56.3,20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"44.7\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,-28.2 L222.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M222.7,-7.8 L212.6,-7.4 L216.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"204.7\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,28.2 L222.7,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M222.7,7.8 L216.3,15.6 L212.6,7.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"195.3\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p><strong>Concatenaci\u00f3n</strong>, <code>ab</code> (el estado 1 es a la vez el final de <code>a</code> y el inicial de <code>b</code>):</p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-th-concat\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -31 252 62\" width=\"252\" height=\"62\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Thompson para ab\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L61.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M61.0,0.0 L52.0,4.5 L52.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"40.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p><strong>Clausura</strong>, <code>a*</code> (arriba la vuelta, abajo el salto):</p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-th-estrella\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -84 332 160\" width=\"332\" height=\"160\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Thompson para a*\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L61.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M61.0,0.0 L52.0,4.5 L52.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"40.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,0.0 L221.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,0.0 L212.0,4.5 L212.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M152.1,-17.3 Q120.0,-88.0 87.9,-17.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M87.9,-17.3 L87.5,-27.4 L95.7,-23.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"-62.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M15.8,10.5 Q120.0,80.0 224.2,10.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M224.2,10.5 L219.2,19.3 L214.2,11.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"55.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 1: ab*</h3>\n    <ol>\n      <li>Piezas sueltas: <code>a</code> y <code>b</code>.</li>\n      <li>Primero la <code>*</code>: <code>b*</code> (la b con sus cuatro \u03b5).</li>\n      <li>Despu\u00e9s la concatenaci\u00f3n: el final de <code>a</code> se funde con el inicial de <code>b*</code>.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-th-ej\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -84 412 160\" width=\"412\" height=\"160\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson para ab*\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L61.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M61.0,0.0 L52.0,4.5 L52.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"40.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,0.0 L221.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,0.0 L212.0,4.5 L212.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M259.0,0.0 L301.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,0.0 L292.0,4.5 L292.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M232.1,-17.3 Q200.0,-88.0 167.9,-17.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M167.9,-17.3 L167.5,-27.4 L175.7,-23.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"-62.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M95.8,10.5 Q200.0,80.0 304.2,10.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M304.2,10.5 L299.2,19.3 L294.2,11.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"55.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>Los estados se numeran de izquierda a derecha: as\u00ed la tabla del paso siguiente es f\u00e1cil de seguir.</p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 2: (a|b)c</h3>\n    <ol>\n      <li>El par\u00e9ntesis primero: <code>a|b</code> (inicial 0, final 5).</li>\n      <li>Concatenaci\u00f3n con <code>c</code>: el 5 pasa a ser el inicial de la <code>c</code>.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-th-ej2\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -67 412 134\" width=\"412\" height=\"134\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson para (a|b)c\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,-36.0 L141.0,-36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,-36.0 L132.0,-31.5 L132.0,-40.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"-46.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,36.0 L141.0,36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,36.0 L132.0,40.5 L132.0,31.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"26.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,-7.8 L62.7,-28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M62.7,-28.2 L56.3,-20.4 L52.6,-28.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"35.3\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,7.8 L62.7,28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M62.7,28.2 L52.6,28.6 L56.3,20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"44.7\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,-28.2 L222.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M222.7,-7.8 L212.6,-7.4 L216.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"204.7\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,28.2 L222.7,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M222.7,7.8 L216.3,15.6 L212.6,7.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"195.3\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M259.0,0.0 L301.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,0.0 L292.0,4.5 L292.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">6</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>En la concatenaci\u00f3n <strong>no se agrega \u03b5</strong>: los dos estados son uno solo (es como lo hace la c\u00e1tedra).</li>\n        <li>En la <code>*</code> faltan muchas veces la \u03b5 de \"cero veces\" (inicial nuevo &rarr; final nuevo) o la de \"repetir\" (final de r &rarr; inicial de r). Son cuatro \u03b5, siempre.</li>\n        <li><code>a|b|c</code> se arma como <code>(a|b)|c</code>: dos uniones anidadas (todo asocia por izquierda).</li>\n        <li>Respet\u00e1 la prioridad: en <code>ab*</code> la <code>*</code> envuelve solo a la b.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bloque\">\n    <p class=\"kicker\">Paso 2 de 3</p>\n    <h2>2. Subconjuntos: de AFN-\u03b5 a AFD</h2>\n\n    <h3>Qu\u00e9 es</h3>\n    <p>\n      Cada estado del AFD es un <strong>conjunto de estados</strong> de Thompson: \"todos los lugares\n      donde podr\u00eda estar el AFN-\u03b5 en este momento\". As\u00ed desaparecen las \u03b5 y las opciones: desde cada\n      conjunto, con cada s\u00edmbolo, se va a un \u00fanico conjunto.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3>Las dos funciones</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Funci\u00f3n</th><th>Qu\u00e9 devuelve</th><th>C\u00f3mo se calcula</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u03b5-clausura(T)</td><td>Los estados a los que se llega desde T usando <strong>solo \u03b5</strong> (cero o m\u00e1s)</td><td>Empezar con T (los de T entran siempre) y agregar todo lo que se alcanza siguiendo flechas \u03b5, una y otra vez</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">mueve(T, a)</td><td>Los estados a los que se llega desde T con <strong>una flecha a</strong></td><td>Mirar cada estado de T: si tiene una flecha a, anotar a d\u00f3nde va. Sin seguir \u03b5</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>El algoritmo</h3>\n    <ol>\n      <li>El inicial del AFD es <code>A = \u03b5-clausura({inicial de Thompson})</code>.</li>\n      <li>Para cada estado nuevo T y cada s\u00edmbolo a: <code>U = \u03b5-clausura(mueve(T, a))</code>. Si U no apareci\u00f3 antes, es un estado nuevo (se le pone la letra siguiente). La casilla \u03b4(T, a) es U.</li>\n      <li>Se sigue hasta que no aparezcan estados nuevos.</li>\n      <li>Son <strong>finales</strong> los conjuntos que contienen el final de Thompson.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <p>Si <code>mueve</code> da vac\u00edo, la casilla va a <code>\u2205</code>: el estado muerto.</p>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 1: ab*</h3>\n    <p>El AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson (secci\u00f3n 1):</p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-th-ej\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -84 412 160\" width=\"412\" height=\"160\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson para ab*\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L61.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M61.0,0.0 L52.0,4.5 L52.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"40.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M179.0,0.0 L221.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M221.0,0.0 L212.0,4.5 L212.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,0.0 L141.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,0.0 L132.0,4.5 L132.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M259.0,0.0 L301.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,0.0 L292.0,4.5 L292.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M232.1,-17.3 Q200.0,-88.0 167.9,-17.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M167.9,-17.3 L167.5,-27.4 L175.7,-23.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"-62.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M95.8,10.5 Q200.0,80.0 304.2,10.5\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M304.2,10.5 L299.2,19.3 L294.2,11.8 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"200.0\" y=\"55.3\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <ol>\n      <li><code>A = \u03b5-clausura({0}) = {0}</code>: del 0 no sale ninguna \u03b5.</li>\n      <li><code>mueve(A, a) = {1}</code>; <code>\u03b5-clausura({1}) = {1, 2, 4}</code> (del 1 con \u03b5 al 2 y al 4) = <strong>B</strong>.</li>\n      <li><code>mueve(A, b) = \u2205</code>: el 0 no tiene flecha b. Va a <strong>\u2205</strong>.</li>\n      <li><code>mueve(B, a) = \u2205</code>. <code>mueve(B, b) = {3}</code> (el 2 tiene la b); <code>\u03b5-clausura({3}) = {2, 3, 4}</code> = <strong>C</strong>.</li>\n      <li><code>mueve(C, a) = \u2205</code>. <code>mueve(C, b) = {3}</code> &rarr; otra vez <code>{2, 3, 4}</code> = <strong>C</strong>. No hay estados nuevos: se termina.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Estado del AFD</th><th>Estados de Thompson</th><th>mueve(T, a)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con a va a</th><th>mueve(T, b)</th><th>\u03b5-clausura: con b va a</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">A</td><td>{0}</td><td>{1}</td><td>{1, 2, 4} = <strong>B</strong></td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B (final)</td><td>{1, 2, 4}</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>{3}</td><td>{2, 3, 4} = <strong>C</strong></td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C (final)</td><td>{2, 3, 4}</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205 = <strong>\u2205</strong></td><td>{3}</td><td>{2, 3, 4} = <strong>C</strong></td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>B y C son finales porque tienen al 4 (el final de Thompson).</p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-sub-ej-afd\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -52 436 265\" width=\"436\" height=\"265\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L133.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M133.0,0.0 L124.0,4.5 L124.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"76.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M14.2,12.7 L137.8,123.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M137.8,123.3 L128.1,120.7 L134.1,114.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"84.4\" y=\"58.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M171.0,0.0 L285.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M285.0,0.0 L276.0,4.5 L276.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"228.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M152.0,19.0 L152.0,117.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M152.0,117.0 L147.5,108.0 L156.5,108.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"138.2\" y=\"68.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M320.8,-8.9 C355.2,-40.0 355.2,40.0 320.8,8.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M320.8,8.9 L330.5,11.6 L324.4,18.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"358.8\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M289.8,12.7 L166.2,123.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M166.2,123.3 L169.9,114.0 L175.9,120.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"219.6\" y=\"58.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M160.9,152.8 C192.0,187.2 112.0,187.2 143.1,152.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M143.1,152.8 L140.4,162.5 L133.7,156.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"192.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"304.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"304.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"304.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"136.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"136.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 2: (a|b)c</h3>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-th-ej2\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -67 412 134\" width=\"412\" height=\"134\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson para (a|b)c\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,-36.0 L141.0,-36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,-36.0 L132.0,-31.5 L132.0,-40.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"-46.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M99.0,36.0 L141.0,36.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M141.0,36.0 L132.0,40.5 L132.0,31.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"26.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,-7.8 L62.7,-28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M62.7,-28.2 L56.3,-20.4 L52.6,-28.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"35.3\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M17.3,7.8 L62.7,28.2\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M62.7,28.2 L52.6,28.6 L56.3,20.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"44.7\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,-28.2 L222.7,-7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M222.7,-7.8 L212.6,-7.4 L216.3,-15.6 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"204.7\" y=\"-28.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M177.3,28.2 L222.7,7.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M222.7,7.8 L216.3,15.6 L212.6,7.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"195.3\" y=\"7.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u03b5</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M259.0,0.0 L301.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M301.0,0.0 L292.0,4.5 L292.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"280.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">c</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">1</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"-36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"-36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"80.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"80.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"160.0\" cy=\"36.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"160.0\" y=\"36.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">0</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"240.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"240.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"320.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"320.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">6</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <ul>\n      <li><code>A = \u03b5-clausura({0}) = {0, 1, 2}</code>.</li>\n      <li>Con a: <code>mueve(A, a) = {3}</code> &rarr; <code>{3, 5}</code> = B. Con b: <code>{4}</code> &rarr; <code>{4, 5}</code> = C. Con c: \u2205.</li>\n      <li>Desde B y desde C, con c: <code>mueve = {6}</code> &rarr; <code>{6}</code> = D (final). Con a o b: \u2205.</li>\n      <li>Desde D, todo va a \u2205.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Fijate que B y C hacen exactamente lo mismo: eso lo arregla la minimizaci\u00f3n (secci\u00f3n 3).</p>\n\n    <h3>En la hoja: la lista de flechas con letra</h3>\n    <p>\n      En Thompson casi todas las flechas son \u03b5; las que tienen letra son pocas. Antes de empezar,\n      anotalas aparte, agrupadas por letra. Para (a|b)c:\n    </p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>Letra</th><th>Flechas</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">a</td><td>1 &rarr; 3</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">b</td><td>2 &rarr; 4</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">c</td><td>5 &rarr; 6</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <p>\n      As\u00ed <code>mueve(T, a)</code> sale de mirar una sola fila: \u00bfT tiene al 1? Entonces va al 3. El\n      dibujo se mira solo para las \u03b5-clausuras.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>La \u03b5-clausura <strong>incluye</strong> a los estados de partida.</li>\n        <li>Hay que seguir las \u03b5 <strong>encadenadas</strong>: si 3 &rarr;\u03b5 5 y 5 &rarr;\u03b5 7, el 7 tambi\u00e9n entra.</li>\n        <li>La \u03b5 que m\u00e1s se olvida es la <strong>vuelta</strong> de una clausura (del final de r al inicial de r): en la \u03b5-clausura de un estado que est\u00e1 al final de una <code>*</code>, el inicio de esa <code>*</code> tambi\u00e9n entra.</li>\n        <li>Para saber si un conjunto ya existe, compar\u00e1 los <strong>conjuntos</strong>, no c\u00f3mo llegaste a \u00e9l.</li>\n        <li>Escrib\u00ed los conjuntos ordenados ({2, 3, 4}, no {4, 2, 3}): as\u00ed se ve r\u00e1pido si se repiten.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bloque\">\n    <p class=\"kicker\">Paso 3 de 3</p>\n    <h2>3. Minimizaci\u00f3n</h2>\n\n    <h3>Qu\u00e9 es</h3>\n    <p>\n      Juntar los estados que <strong>no se distinguen</strong>: los que, lea lo que lea la m\u00e1quina\n      desde ah\u00ed, aceptan y rechazan exactamente las mismas cadenas. Para todo AFD existe uno\n      equivalente con la m\u00ednima cantidad de estados, y este algoritmo lo encuentra.\n    </p>\n    <p>\n      Dos estados son <strong>distinguibles</strong> si hay una cadena w que desde uno lleva a un final\n      y desde el otro a un no final. Ejemplo: un final y un no final se distinguen con w = \u03b5.\n    </p>\n\n    <h3>El algoritmo (particiones)</h3>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>P1</strong>: dos grupos, los finales y los no finales (el \u2205 va con los no finales).</li>\n      <li>Para cada grupo, mirar cada estado: <strong>con cada s\u00edmbolo, \u00bfa qu\u00e9 grupo va?</strong> Los que van a los mismos grupos con todos los s\u00edmbolos se quedan juntos; los dem\u00e1s se separan.</li>\n      <li>La partici\u00f3n nueva es P2. Si es igual a la anterior, se termina; si no, se repite el paso 2 con P2.</li>\n      <li>Cada grupo final es un estado del AFD m\u00ednimo. Es inicial el grupo que tiene al inicial; son finales los grupos de finales.</li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"caja caja-formula\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">La pregunta de cada ronda</span>\n      <p>Para cada estado de un grupo, armar su \"firma\": <strong>a qu\u00e9 grupo va con cada s\u00edmbolo</strong>. Misma firma = mismo grupo.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 1: el AFD de ab*</h3>\n    <p>El AFD de la secci\u00f3n 2:</p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-sub-ej-afd\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -52 436 265\" width=\"436\" height=\"265\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L133.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M133.0,0.0 L124.0,4.5 L124.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"76.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M14.2,12.7 L137.8,123.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M137.8,123.3 L128.1,120.7 L134.1,114.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"84.4\" y=\"58.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M171.0,0.0 L285.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M285.0,0.0 L276.0,4.5 L276.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"228.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M152.0,19.0 L152.0,117.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M152.0,117.0 L147.5,108.0 L156.5,108.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"138.2\" y=\"68.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M320.8,-8.9 C355.2,-40.0 355.2,40.0 320.8,8.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M320.8,8.9 L330.5,11.6 L324.4,18.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"358.8\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M289.8,12.7 L166.2,123.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M166.2,123.3 L169.9,114.0 L175.9,120.7 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"219.6\" y=\"58.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M160.9,152.8 C192.0,187.2 112.0,187.2 143.1,152.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M143.1,152.8 L140.4,162.5 L133.7,156.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"192.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"304.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"304.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"304.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"136.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"136.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>P1</strong> = {B, C} &nbsp; {A, \u2205}</li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {B, C}: con a, B va a \u2205 y C va a \u2205 (los dos al grupo {A, \u2205}); con b, B va a C y C va a C\n        (los dos al grupo {B, C}). <strong>Misma firma: siguen juntos.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li>\n        Grupo {A, \u2205}: con a, A va a B (grupo {B, C}) pero \u2205 va a \u2205 (grupo {A, \u2205}). <strong>Firmas\n        distintas: se separan.</strong>\n      </li>\n      <li><strong>P2</strong> = {B, C} &nbsp; {A} &nbsp; {\u2205}</li>\n      <li>Otra ronda: {B, C} sigue igual (los dos van a \u2205 con a y a {B, C} con b). <strong>P3</strong> = P2: se termina.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>B y C se juntan (queda B):</p>\n    <div class=\"pd-grafico af\" data-g=\"u3-min-ej\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"-61 -52 284 265\" width=\"284\" height=\"265\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Diagrama de un aut\u00f3mata finito\">\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M19.0,0.0 L133.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M133.0,0.0 L124.0,4.5 L124.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"76.0\" y=\"-10.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M14.2,12.7 L137.8,123.3\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M137.8,123.3 L128.1,120.7 L134.1,114.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"84.4\" y=\"58.7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M168.8,-8.9 C203.2,-40.0 203.2,40.0 168.8,8.9\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M168.8,8.9 L178.5,11.6 L172.4,18.3 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"206.8\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M152.0,19.0 L152.0,117.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M152.0,117.0 L147.5,108.0 L156.5,108.0 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"138.2\" y=\"68.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M160.9,152.8 C192.0,187.2 112.0,187.2 143.1,152.8\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M143.1,152.8 L140.4,162.5 L133.7,156.4 Z\"/>\n        <text class=\"rot\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"192.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">a, b</text>\n        <path class=\"arco\" d=\"M-49.0,0.0 L-19.0,0.0\"/>\n        <path class=\"punta\" d=\"M-19.0,0.0 L-28.0,4.5 L-28.0,-4.5 Z\"/>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"0.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"0.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"0.0\" r=\"15\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"0.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text>\n        </g>\n        <g class=\"estado muerto\">\n          <circle class=\"borde\" cx=\"152.0\" cy=\"136.0\" r=\"19\"/>\n          <text class=\"nom\" x=\"152.0\" y=\"136.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">\u2205</text>\n        </g>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3 class=\"h-ej\">Ejemplo 2: el AFD de (a|b)c</h3>\n    <p>Estados A, B, C, D (final) y \u2205, con las transiciones de la secci\u00f3n 2.</p>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t\">\n        <tr><th>&delta;</th><th>a</th><th>b</th><th>c</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">&rarr; A</td><td>B</td><td>C</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">B</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>D</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">C</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>D</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">D *</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td><td>\u2205</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n    <ul>\n      <li><strong>P1</strong> = {D} &nbsp; {A, B, C, \u2205}</li>\n      <li>Firmas en {A, B, C, \u2205} (grupo al que van con a, b, c): A &rarr; (no fin, no fin, no fin); B &rarr; (no fin, no fin, <strong>{D}</strong>); C &rarr; igual que B; \u2205 &rarr; (no fin, no fin, no fin).</li>\n      <li><strong>P2</strong> = {D} &nbsp; {B, C} &nbsp; {A, \u2205}</li>\n      <li>Ronda 2: en {A, \u2205}, con a, A va a B (grupo {B, C}) y \u2205 va a \u2205: se separan. {B, C} sigue junto.</li>\n      <li><strong>P3</strong> = {D} &nbsp; {B, C} &nbsp; {A} &nbsp; {\u2205}. Ronda 3: no cambia. Se termina.</li>\n    </ul>\n    <p>Resultado: 4 estados (A, BC, D y \u2205). Se ve que hac\u00edan falta <strong>dos rondas</strong>: no hay que cortar en P2.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Errores y trampas</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>La firma se arma con el <strong>grupo</strong> al que va, no con el estado: \"B va a C y C va a C\" es la misma firma si los dos destinos est\u00e1n en el mismo grupo.</li>\n        <li>Cada ronda se compara contra la partici\u00f3n <strong>anterior</strong> completa, no contra la que est\u00e1s armando.</li>\n        <li>Nunca se juntan un final y un no final.</li>\n        <li>El \u2205 entra en la minimizaci\u00f3n como cualquier no final. Si al final queda solo, es el estado muerto del AFD m\u00ednimo.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"bloque\">\n    <p class=\"kicker\">Todo junto</p>\n    <h2>4. La receta en la hoja</h2>\n\n    <p>El ejercicio vale 60 puntos y tiene muchas cuentas. Entregalo siempre en este orden, cada parte con su t\u00edtulo:</p>\n    <ol>\n      <li><strong>AFN-\u03b5 de Thompson</strong>, con los estados numerados. Si la ER es larga, dibuj\u00e1 antes las piezas chicas.</li>\n      <li><strong>Tabla de subconjuntos</strong>: cada estado del AFD con su conjunto, y para cada s\u00edmbolo el mueve y la \u03b5-clausura.</li>\n      <li><strong>AFD</strong>: la tabla \u03b4 (con &rarr; en el inicial y * en los finales) y, si hay tiempo, el dibujo.</li>\n      <li><strong>Minimizaci\u00f3n</strong>: P1, P2, ... hasta que se repita, diciendo por qu\u00e9 se separa cada grupo.</li>\n      <li><strong>AFD m\u00ednimo</strong> dibujado, con inicial, finales y estado muerto.</li>\n    </ol>\n\n    <h3>Controles r\u00e1pidos antes de entregar</h3>\n    <div class=\"tabla-wrap\">\n      <table class=\"t full\">\n        <tr><th>Control</th><th>C\u00f3mo</th></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u00bfEs determin\u00edstico?</td><td>Desde cada estado, una sola flecha por s\u00edmbolo y ninguna \u03b5</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u00bfAcepta lo que tiene que aceptar?</td><td>Le\u00e9 la ER en palabras (Unidad 1, secci\u00f3n 5), eleg\u00ed 2 cadenas que s\u00ed y 2 que no, y recorrelas</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u00bf\u03b5?</td><td>Si la ER genera \u03b5 (por ejemplo <code>a*</code> o <code>(ab)*</code> solas), el inicial del m\u00ednimo tiene que ser final</td></tr>\n        <tr><td class=\"lbl\">\u00bfEs m\u00ednimo?</td><td>La \u00faltima partici\u00f3n se repiti\u00f3: no hay dos estados con la misma firma</td></tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3>Atajos que no reemplazan el m\u00e9todo</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Pensar el lenguaje en palabras te dice <strong>cu\u00e1ntos estados</strong> deber\u00eda tener el m\u00ednimo m\u00e1s o menos. Si el algoritmo da muy distinto, revis\u00e1 las clausuras.</li>\n      <li>Estados del AFD con <strong>exactamente las mismas filas</strong> en la tabla \u03b4 (y los dos finales o los dos no) se van a juntar seguro.</li>\n      <li>El inicial y el \u2205 nunca terminan en el mismo grupo (salvo que la ER no genere ninguna cadena): si en tu partici\u00f3n quedan juntos, todav\u00eda falta una ronda.</li>\n      <li>En una ronda, los estados que se separan <strong>de la misma forma</strong> (misma firma) van juntos a un grupo nuevo, no uno a cada grupo.</li>\n      <li>Igual piden el procedimiento: un AFD m\u00ednimo \"adivinado\" sin Thompson ni tablas no suma los 60 puntos.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"caja caja-ojo\">\n      <span class=\"caja-tit\">Lo que m\u00e1s puntos hace perder</span>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Una \u03b5 olvidada en Thompson: arrastra el error a todas las tablas. Revis\u00e1 cada <code>*</code> (cuatro \u03b5) y cada <code>|</code> (cuatro \u03b5).</li>\n        <li>Una \u03b5-clausura incompleta (no seguir \u03b5 encadenadas).</li>\n        <li>Cortar la minimizaci\u00f3n en P2 sin comprobar que P3 es igual.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>");
